{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"rensu-e-o181","title":"黄初中乐详征拜博士；太学初立博士十余人略不亲教，惟详五业并授、以杖画地牵譬引类至忘寝食，独擅名远近","accounts":[{"id":"rensu-a-543de1368c4068f2e432","label":"裴注·魏略","text":"黄初中乐详征拜博士；太学初立博士十余人略不亲教，惟详五业并授、以杖画地牵譬引类至忘寝食，独擅名远近","evidence":["rensu-q-9b5afc66f4ba6d3ac235"]}],"participants":[{"person":"rensu-p0001","role":"五业并授之博士","evidence":["rensu-q-9b5afc66f4ba6d3ac235"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["rensu-q-9b5afc66f4ba6d3ac235"]},"ordering_evidence":"rensu-q-9b5afc66f4ba6d3ac235","source_order":[16,312,126],"order":3441}],"persons":[{"id":"rensu-p0001","name":"乐详","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"rensu-q-9b5afc66f4ba6d3ac235","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-7bf59cb2b376dfc3aa4d","layer":"pei","quote":"至黄初中，征拜博士。于时太学初立，有博士十余人。学多褊狭，又不熟悉；略不亲教，备员而已。惟详，五业并授；其或难教，质而不解，详无愠色；以杖画地，牵譬引类，至忘寝食。以是独擅名于远近","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":311,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-d8fdacafc497b3097224","start":126,"end":216,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
